### JWT Authentication Test Dosyası

### 1. Kullanıcı Kaydı (Register)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/User/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "passwordHash": "password123"
}

### 2. Kullanıcı Girişi (Login)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/User/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Profil Bilgilerini Getir (Authentication Gerekli)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/User/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. İşlem Oluştur (Authentication Gerekli)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Transaction
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "userId": 1,
  "amount": 100.50,
  "type": 1,
  "category": "Market",
  "description": "Market alışverişi",
  "transactionDate": "2024-01-15T10:00:00Z"
}

### 5. İşlemleri Listele (Authentication Gerekli)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Transaction
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Bakiye Oluştur (Authentication Gerekli)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Balance/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "amount": 500.75
}

### 7. Bakiye Geçmişini Getir (Authentication Gerekli)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Balance/history/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Taksit Oluştur (Authentication Gerekli)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Installment
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "userId": 1,
  "originalAmount": 10000,
  "interestRate": 12.5,
  "interestType": 0,
  "totalInstallments": 12,
  "nextPaymentDate": "2024-02-15T00:00:00Z"
}

### 9. Taksit Hesapla (Authentication Gerekli)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Installment/calculate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "originalAmount": 50000,
  "interestRate": 15.0,
  "interestType": 0,
  "totalInstallments": 24
}

### 10. Geçersiz Token ile Erişim Denemesi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Transaction
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_here

### 11. Token Olmadan Erişim Denemesi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Transaction

### 12. Token Süresi Dolmuş Test (60 dakika sonra)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Transaction
Authorization: Bearer {{expiredToken}}

### 13. Kullanıcı Güncelleme (Authentication Gerekli)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/User/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "userName": "updateduser",
  "email": "updated@example.com",
  "passwordHash": "newpassword123"
}

### 14. İşlem Güncelleme (Authentication Gerekli)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Transaction/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "amount": 150.25,
  "description": "Güncellenmiş açıklama",
  "date": "2024-01-16T10:00:00Z",
  "category": "Market",
  "type": 1
}

### 15. Bakiye Güncelleme (Authentication Gerekli)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Balance/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "amount": 750.50
}

### 16. Taksit Güncelleme (Authentication Gerekli)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Installment/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "interestRate": 14.0,
  "interestType": 0,
  "totalInstallments": 18,
  "nextPaymentDate": "2024-03-15T00:00:00Z",
  "isActive": true
}

### 17. Ödeme İşlemi (Authentication Gerekli)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Installment/1/payment
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

1000.00

### 18. Faiz Türlerini Getir (Authentication Gerekli)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Installment/interest-types
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 19. Karşılaştırma Hesaplama (Authentication Gerekli)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Installment/calculate-comparison
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "originalAmount": 30000,
  "interestRate": 18.0,
  "interestType": 0,
  "totalInstallments": 36
}

### 20. Kullanıcı Silme (Authentication Gerekli)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/User/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Not: {{authToken}} değişkeni login response'undan alınan JWT token ile değiştirilmelidir.
### {{expiredToken}} değişkeni süresi dolmuş bir token ile değiştirilmelidir.
